# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. Skipping the reconcile when
# the shard map changed mid-export is safe only if the pass is retried;
# otherwise r keeps the deleted value.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceReshardSkipNotRetried
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a pass whose reconcile a reshard skipped is not retried, so the reaped delete is never reconciled
PERTURBS: EndExport

--- FIND
               ELSE \/ topo # ex.topo0 \/ phys # ex.phys0 \/ ex.del0 \/ deleted \/ delDone # ex.dep0
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a shard-map change does not leave the pass owed.
               ELSE \/ phys # ex.phys0 \/ ex.del0 \/ deleted \/ delDone # ex.dep0
--- END
